The [[Wonky Snowman]] is an [[accessory]] available in the shop for all classes. It isn't a usable item in and of itself, only splitting into two [[Snowball]]s on purchase, which are useful for crafting, inflicting a bit of {{icon/cold}}, and applying a reduction to the opponent's maximum health gain..
